      "appeals_to_c1_and_c3": "Compliment C1 and C3 for their rigorous analysis in Round 2, and invite them to apply the Stage 1 / Stage 2 structural filter to see that Tryndamere is the exact edge case the question designer drafted Paragraph 2 to exclude."
